{"diagnosis": "SLTIU store shows datao=00000000 vs expected 00000001 for 5000 < -1 unsigned-true test. Excerpt line 531 builds U2REGX as XMCC ? UIMM : U2REG, zero-extending I-imm 0xFFF to 4095 instead of sign-extended 0xFFFFFFFF, so unsigned compare 5000 < 4095 is false. CONE_SLICE refs boards/de10nano_cyclonev_mister/sys/hq2x.sv:105,130,230,245,246,254,264 carry no darkriscv ALU cone, so trace wins and root cause is the UIMM selection for the SLTIU path.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/rtl/darkriscv.v b/rtl/darkriscv.v
--- a/rtl/darkriscv.v
+++ b/rtl/darkriscv.v
@@ -528,5 +528,5 @@
     // RM-group of instructions (OPCODEs==7'b0010011/7'b0110011), merged! src=immediate(M)/register(R)

     wire signed [31:0] S2REGX = XMCC ? SIMM : S2REG;
-    wire        [31:0] U2REGX = XMCC ? UIMM : U2REG;
+    wire        [31:0] U2REGX = XMCC ? SIMM : U2REG;
", "expected": "tohost PASS with store daddr=00000000 datao=00000001, no TRAP sltiu line"}

